00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:02.560
that you're serving for your customers?

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:05.020
What is it they need or want?

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.581
And then the big thing around this topic

00:06:07.581 --> 00:06:10.951
