00:06:15.426 --> 00:06:18.245
And how do you differentiate yourself?

00:06:18.245 --> 00:06:21.781
You build massive early
massive loyalty, fanaticism.

00:06:21.781 --> 00:06:25.333
We want your customers
to be fanatical for you

00:06:25.333 --> 00:06:28.050
and feel love for your brand

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:29.791
and your product and your service.

00:06:29.791 --> 00:06:31.502
So, I think they're the things.

00:06:31.502 --> 00:06:34.859
Now number one, sit in the
shoes of your customers.

00:06:34.859 --> 00:06:38.069
Secondly, really think
about what is it they want,

00:06:38.069 --> 00:06:40.449
